   - `query-` Query Performance (CRITICAL)
   - `conn-` Connection Management (CRITICAL)
   - `security-` Security & RLS (CRITICAL)
   - `schema-` Schema Design (HIGH)
   - `lock-` Concurrency & Locking (MEDIUM-HIGH)
   - `data-` Data Access Patterns (MEDIUM)
